'''Hearscht''' (ハルシュト) is an enemy that only appears in [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 3.8 Update|Version 3.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Hearscht
|image = E 163.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
Hearscht's high stats, very high HP, damage, critical chance and range all would have made her extremely threatening. Fortunately, this enemy is single target, so she isn't that much of a threat.

==Strategy==
Due to having single target, strategies on fighting this enemy are relatively straightforward. One should spam as many meatshields as possible, nullifying her range advantage while stacking on ranged attackers that can safely whittle her down.

